---
title: "an Airflow task instance, from scheduled to done"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  s0: scheduled
  s1: queued
  s2: running
  s3: success
  s4: up for retry
  s5: failed
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the scheduler finds a slot
  s1 --> s2: a worker picks it up
  s2 --> s3: the task returns
  s2 --> s4: the task raises [while retries remain]
  s2 --> s5: the task raises [unless retries remain]
  s4 --> s1: the retry delay passes
  s3 --> [*]
  s5 --> [*]
